# Zone pins for direct-network mode (hosts format: IP hostname).
# Names not listed here are resolved with DNS-over-HTTPS instead.
# Public DNS returns no AAAA for x.com, so the IPv6 pin below (the
# anycast address) is the only IPv6 path. The syndication name is
# pinned to the anycast address of its dual-stack Fastly target,
# which a hosts file cannot express as a CNAME. IPv6 only, on
# purpose: getting traffic onto IPv6 is the point of these pins.
2a04:4e42::658 x.com
2a04:4e42::159 cdn.syndication.twimg.com
